<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DIGITAL MONSTER REFERENCE BOOK | 디지털 월드 디지몬 도감</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Orbitron, JetBrains Mono, Noto Sans KR -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700;900&family=Orbitron:wght@500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['"Noto Sans KR"', 'sans-serif'],
                        cyber: ['"Orbitron"', 'sans-serif'],
                        mono: ['"JetBrains Mono"', 'monospace'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        digi: {
                            bg: '#060b14',
                            panel: '#0c1526',
                            card: '#101d35',
                            border: '#1e3a5f',
                            cyan: '#00f0ff',
                            blue: '#2563eb',
                            orange: '#ff6b00',
                            gold: '#fbbf24',
                            virus: '#ef4444',
                            vaccine: '#38bdf8',
                            data: '#10b981',
                            free: '#a855f7'
                        }
                    },
                    boxShadow: {
                        'neon-cyan': '0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35)',
                        'neon-orange': '0 0 15px rgba(255, 107, 0, 0.35)',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        /* Cyberpunk Digital Grid Background */
        body {
            background-color: #060b14;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08) 0%, transparent 55%),
                linear-gradient(rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 100% 100%, 32px 32px, 32px 32px;
        }

        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 7px; height: 7px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #060b14; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #1e3a5f; border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #00f0ff; }

        /* Hologram Scanline Effect */
        .holo-scan {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .holo-scan::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                0deg,
                rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03) 0px,
                rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03) 1px,
                transparent 1px,
                transparent 3px
            );
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Digimon Card Hover Glow */
        .digimon-card {
            transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
        }
        .digimon-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: #00f0ff;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25), 0 0 12px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
        }

        /* Corner Tech Accents */
        .tech-corner {
            clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 14px) 0, 100% 14px, 100% 100%, 14px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 14px));
        }

        @keyframes pulseSlow {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.75; }
            50% { opacity: 1; }
        }
        .animate-pulse-slow {
            animation: pulseSlow 3s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-cyan-500 selection:text-slate-950">

    <!-- Top Terminal Header -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-30 bg-digi-panel/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-digi-border shadow-lg">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-3.5">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <!-- Brand Title -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
                    <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-blue-700 p-0.5 shadow-neon-cyan shrink-0">
                        <div class="w-full h-full bg-digi-bg rounded-[10px] flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
                            <!-- Digital Crest SVG Icon -->
                            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-cyan-400" viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none">
                                <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 2"/>
                                <polygon points="18,6 28,18 18,30 8,18" stroke="#ff6b00" stroke-width="2" fill="rgba(255,107,0,0.15)"/>
                                <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="3.5" fill="#00f0ff"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-cyan-500/15 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/40 rounded">SYS.VER 4.26 // DIGITAL WORLD DB</span>
                        </div>
                        <h1 class="font-cyber font-black text-lg sm:text-2xl tracking-wider text-white mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2">
                            DIGIMON <span class="text-cyan-400">REFERENCE</span> <span class="text-digi-orange hidden sm:inline">BOOK</span>
                        </h1>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Status Counters & Attribute Chart Trigger -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-4">
                    <!-- Total Digimon Counter -->
                    <div class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-digi-card border border-digi-border flex items-center gap-2.5">
                        <div class="text-right">
                            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase">Registered</div>
                            <div class="font-cyber font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-cyan-400" id="totalCountDisplay">25 <span class="text-xs font-sans font-normal text-slate-400">종</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-database text-cyan-500/70 text-lg"></i>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Partner Favorites Counter -->
                    <button onclick="toggleFavoriteOnly()" id="headerFavBtn" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-digi-card border border-digi-border hover:border-amber-400 transition-all flex items-center gap-2.5 group" title="파트너 디지몬(즐겨찾기) 필터 토글">
                        <div class="text-right">
                            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase">Partners</div>
                            <div class="font-cyber font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-amber-400" id="favCountDisplay">0 <span class="text-xs font-sans font-normal text-slate-400">체</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-amber-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform text-lg"></i>
                    </button>

                    <!-- Attribute Compatibility Guide Button -->
                    <button onclick="openTypeChartModal()" class="px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600/30 to-blue-600/30 hover:from-cyan-500/40 hover:to-blue-500/40 border border-cyan-500/50 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-2 transition-all shadow-sm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project"></i>
                        <span class="hidden md:inline">속성 상성표</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Control & Search Dashboard -->
    <main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 space-y-6">

        <!-- Search, Filter & Sort Control Panel -->
        <section class="bg-digi-panel/90 border border-digi-border rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-xl space-y-4">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-3.5 items-center">
                <!-- Search Input -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-cyan-400 text-sm"></i>
                    <input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="디지몬 이름(한/영), 종족, 필살기 검색 (예: 오메가몬, 성기사형, 그레이 소드)..."
                        class="w-full pl-10 pr-9 py-2.5 bg-digi-bg border border-digi-border focus:border-cyan-400 rounded-xl text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-500 outline-none transition-all font-sans">
                    <button id="clearSearchBtn" onclick="clearSearch()" class="hidden absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-xmark"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Attribute Filter Pills -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 mr-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved mr-1 text-cyan-400"></i>속성:</span>
                    <button onclick="setAttrFilter('ALL')" data-attr="ALL" class="attr-btn active px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-cyan-500 text-slate-950 transition-all">전체</button>
                    <button onclick="setAttrFilter('백신')" data-attr="백신" class="attr-btn px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-digi-card border border-digi-border text-sky-400 hover:border-sky-400 transition-all">백신</button>
                    <button onclick="setAttrFilter('데이터')" data-attr="데이터" class="attr-btn px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-digi-card border border-digi-border text-emerald-400 hover:border-emerald-400 transition-all">데이터</button>
                    <button onclick="setAttrFilter('바이러스')" data-attr="바이러스" class="attr-btn px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-digi-card border border-digi-border text-rose-400 hover:border-rose-400 transition-all">바이러스</button>
                    <button onclick="setAttrFilter('프리')" data-attr="프리" class="attr-btn px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-digi-card border border-digi-border text-purple-400 hover:border-purple-400 transition-all">프리</button>
                </div>

                <!-- Sort & Favorites Toggle -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-3 flex items-center justify-between lg:justify-end gap-2">
                    <select id="sortSelect" onchange="renderGrid()" class="bg-digi-bg border border-digi-border focus:border-cyan-400 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 outline-none cursor-pointer">
                        <option value="id">도감 번호순 (No.001~)</option>
                        <option value="name">이름순 (가나다)</option>
                        <option value="power">전투력순 (총 스탯)</option>
                    </select>

                    <button id="favFilterBtn" onclick="toggleFavoriteOnly()" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-digi-border bg-digi-card text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 hover:border-amber-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all shrink-0">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-star text-amber-400" id="favFilterIcon"></i>
                        <span>즐겨찾기</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Generation / Stage Filter Bar -->
            <div class="pt-3 border-t border-digi-border/60 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 mr-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-dna mr-1 text-digi-orange"></i>세대:</span>
                    <button onclick="setStageFilter('ALL')" data-stage="ALL" class="stage-btn active px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-digi-orange text-white shadow-neon-orange transition-all">전체 세대</button>
                    <button onclick="setStageFilter('유년기')" data-stage="유년기" class="stage-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-digi-bg border border-digi-border text-slate-300 hover:border-digi-orange transition-all">유년기</button>
                    <button onclick="setStageFilter('성장기')" data-stage="성장기" class="stage-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-digi-bg border border-digi-border text-slate-300 hover:border-digi-orange transition-all">성장기</button>
                    <button onclick="setStageFilter('성숙기')" data-stage="성숙기" class="stage-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-digi-bg border border-digi-border text-slate-300 hover:border-digi-orange transition-all">성숙기</button>
                    <button onclick="setStageFilter('완전체')" data-stage="완전체" class="stage-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-digi-bg border border-digi-border text-slate-300 hover:border-digi-orange transition-all">완전체</button>
                    <button onclick="setStageFilter('궁극체')" data-stage="궁극체" class="stage-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-digi-bg border border-digi-border text-slate-300 hover:border-digi-orange transition-all">궁극체</button>
                    <button onclick="setStageFilter('초궁극체')" data-stage="초궁극체" class="stage-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-digi-bg border border-digi-border text-slate-300 hover:border-digi-orange transition-all">초궁극체</button>
                </div>

                <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
                    검색 결과: <span id="filteredCountText" class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">25</span> 개체
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Digimon Grid Container -->
        <section id="digimonGrid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
            <!-- Cards dynamically injected here -->
        </section>

        <!-- Empty Search Result State -->
        <div id="emptyState" class="hidden text-center py-20 bg-digi-panel/60 border border-digi-border rounded-2xl">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-cyan-400 text-2xl">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-satellite-dish"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-cyber text-lg font-bold text-white">NO DIGITAL DATA FOUND</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">조건에 일치하는 디지몬 데이터가 디지털 월드에 존재하지 않습니다.</p>
            <button onclick="resetAllFilters()" class="mt-5 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs transition-all">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left mr-1.5"></i>필터 전체 초기화
            </button>
        </div>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="border-t border-digi-border/70 bg-digi-panel/60 py-6 px-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">
        <p>DIGITAL MONSTER REFERENCE ARCHIVE // POWERED BY DIGIVICE ANALYZER OS</p>
    </footer>

    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <!-- DIGIVICE ANALYZER MODAL (DIGIMON DETAIL VIEW) -->
    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <div id="detailModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-6 bg-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-md overflow-y-auto" onclick="closeDetailModal(event)">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-4xl bg-digi-panel border-2 border-cyan-500/60 rounded-2xl shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] overflow-hidden my-auto" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
            
            <!-- Modal Top Terminal Bar -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-digi-card to-slate-900 px-5 py-3 border-b border-digi-border flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                    <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-ping"></span>
                    <span class="font-cyber text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-cyan-400">DIGIVICE ANALYZER // DATA PROFILE</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <button id="modalFavBtn" onclick="toggleModalFavorite()" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-star text-amber-400" id="modalFavIcon"></i>
                        <span id="modalFavText">파트너 등록</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="forceCloseDetailModal()" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-rose-500/20 hover:text-rose-400 border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-300 transition-colors">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-base"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Modal Body Content -->
            <div class="p-5 sm:p-7 max-h-[82vh] overflow-y-auto space-y-6">
                
                <!-- Top Section: Artwork + Core Metadata -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-center">
                    <!-- Hologram Artwork Frame -->
                    <div class="md:col-span-5">
                        <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-digi-bg border border-cyan-500/40 p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center holo-scan shadow-inner">
                            <span id="modalNo" class="absolute top-3 left-3.5 font-cyber text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400/80">No.001</span>
                            <span id="modalFieldBadge" class="absolute top-3 right-3.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300">네이처 스피리츠</span>
                            
                            <!-- Custom SVG Illustration Container -->
                            <div id="modalArtwork" class="w-44 h-44 sm:w-52 sm:h-52 my-2 flex items-center justify-center drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.3)]">
                                <!-- SVG injected via JS -->
                            </div>

                            <!-- Total Combat Power Pill -->
                            <div class="mt-2 px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/70 border border-cyan-500/40 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-300 uppercase">Total Power</span>
                                <span id="modalTotalPower" class="font-cyber font-bold text-sm text-white">450</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Name, Badges, Description -->
                    <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-4">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
                                <span id="modalStageBadge" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-digi-orange/20 text-digi-orange border border-digi-orange/40">성장기</span>
                                <span id="modalAttrBadge" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 border border-sky-500/40">백신</span>
                                <span id="modalTypeBadge" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">파충류형</span>
                            </div>
                            <h2 id="modalNameKo" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">아구몬</h2>
                            <p id="modalNameEn" class="font-cyber text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyan-400 tracking-widest uppercase mt-0.5">AGUMON</p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Official Encyclopedia Lore Box -->
                        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-digi-bg/90 border border-digi-border relative">
                            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines"></i> OFFICIAL PROFILE // 도감 해설
                            </div>
                            <p id="modalDesc" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                                두 발로 걸어 다니는 파충류형 디지몬. 아직 성장기라 힘은 약하지만 성격은 상당히 흉포해 무서움을 모른다.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Stats Bars -->
                        <div class="space-y-2 pt-1">
                            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase flex justify-between">
                                <span>PARAMETER ANALYSIS (능력치 분석)</span>
                                <span class="text-cyan-400">MAX 100</span>
                            </div>
                            <div id="modalStatsContainer" class="space-y-2">
                                <!-- Stat bars injected via JS -->
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Middle Section: Special Moves (필살기) -->
                <div class="space-y-2.5">
                    <h3 class="font-cyber text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-digi-orange tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> SPECIAL MOVES // 필살기 데이터
                    </h3>
                    <div id="modalSkillsContainer" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                        <!-- Skills injected via JS -->
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Bottom Section: Interactive Evolution Tree -->
                <div class="space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-digi-border">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <h3 class="font-cyber text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-cyan-400 tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i> EVOLUTION LINE // 진화 트리 (클릭 시 개체 이동)
                        </h3>
                    </div>
                    <div id="modalEvoContainer" class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-digi-bg/80 border border-digi-border">
                        <!-- Evolution nodes injected via JS -->
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <!-- ATTRIBUTE COMPATIBILITY MODAL (상성 가이드) -->
    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <div id="typeChartModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-sm" onclick="closeTypeChartModal(event)">
        <div class="w-full max-w-lg bg-digi-panel border border-cyan-500/50 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-5" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-digi-border pb-3">
                <h3 class="font-cyber font-bold text-base text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-virus"></i> ATTRIBUTE MATRIX // 속성 상성 시스템
                </h3>
                <button onclick="document.getElementById('typeChartModal').classList.add('hidden'); document.getElementById('typeChartModal').classList.remove('flex');" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Triangle Visual SVG -->
            <div class="bg-digi-bg rounded-xl p-4 border border-digi-border flex flex-col items-center">
                <svg class="w-64 h-48" viewBox="0 0 260 190">
                    <!-- Triangle Arrows -->
                    <defs>
                        <marker id="arrowCyan" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
                            <path d="M0,0 L0,6 L7,3 z" fill="#00f0ff" />
                        </marker>
                    </defs>
                    <!-- Vaccine -> Virus -->
                    <line x1="115" y1="45" x2="65" y2="125" stroke="#00f0ff" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arrowCyan)" />
                    <text x="65" y="82" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">유리 (강함)</text>
                    <!-- Virus -> Data -->
                    <line x1="85" y1="148" x2="175" y2="148" stroke="#00f0ff" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arrowCyan)" />
                    <text x="112" y="166" fill="#ef4444" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">유리 (강함)</text>
                    <!-- Data -> Vaccine -->
                    <line x1="195" y1="125" x2="145" y2="45" stroke="#00f0ff" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arrowCyan)" />
                    <text x="178" y="82" fill="#10b981" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">유리 (강함)</text>

                    <!-- Nodes -->
                    <g transform="translate(130, 30)">
                        <rect x="-38" y="-16" width="76" height="32" rx="8" fill="#0c1526" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <text x="0" y="5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="13" font-weight="bold">백신 (Va)</text>
                    </g>
                    <g transform="translate(55, 148)">
                        <rect x="-42" y="-16" width="84" height="32" rx="8" fill="#0c1526" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <text x="0" y="5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ef4444" font-size="13" font-weight="bold">바이러스 (Vi)</text>
                    </g>
                    <g transform="translate(205, 148)">
                        <rect x="-40" y="-16" width="80" height="32" rx="8" fill="#0c1526" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <text x="0" y="5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#10b981" font-size="13" font-weight="bold">데이터 (Da)</text>
                    </g>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                <p><strong class="text-sky-400">• 백신 (Vaccine):</strong> 바이러스종을 정화하고 방어하기 위해 생성된 속성. 바이러스에 강하지만 데이터에 약합니다.</p>
                <p><strong class="text-rose-400">• 바이러스 (Virus):</strong> 환경을 자신에게 유리하게 개조·침식하는 속성. 데이터에 강하지만 백신에 약합니다.</p>
                <p><strong class="text-emerald-400">• 데이터 (Data):</strong> 디지털 월드의 환경에 순응하며 살아가는 속성. 백신에 강하지만 바이러스에 약합니다.</p>
                <p><strong class="text-purple-400">• 프리 (Free):</strong> 고대종이나 특수 진화체에 나타나는 속성으로 기본 3속성 상성의 영향을 받지 않습니다.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Toast Notification -->
    <div id="toast" class="fixed bottom-5 right-5 z-50 transform translate-y-20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none">
        <div class="bg-digi-card border border-cyan-400 text-white px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-neon-cyan text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-cyan-400"></i>
            <span id="toastMsg">메시지</span>
        </div>
    </div>

